                            <comment id="499585" author="JIRAUSER19463" created="Thu, 13 Aug 2026 18:24:27 +0000">&lt;p&gt;this work is inspired by &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=adilger" class="user-hover" rel="adilger"&gt;adilger&lt;/a&gt; and we can reuse the scrub code therefore the iterate API will become OSD agnostic. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="499630" author="adilger" created="Fri, 14 Aug 2026 09:33:56 +0000">&lt;p&gt;Hi &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=jinshanx" class="user-hover" rel="jinshanx"&gt;jinshanx&lt;/a&gt;, there are already some people working on this (both OSD-level scanner and block-device scanner) so we shouldn't duplicate efforts. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
